  "schema": "causa.contract-readiness.ui-field-map/1",
  "status": "CANDIDATE. One binding per CAT-CAUSA-INVESTIGATION requirement (INV-001..044). Label, input type, required and validation are copied from the catalog and the validator checks them against it; write and read-back field IDs must exist in FIELD-REGISTRY.json; commands must exist in COMMAND-EVENT-REGISTRY.json. A binding whose path needs a proposed field or command is 'blocked' until OD-CR-01 and the named decisions are recorded.",
